{"3983750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chip By Chip", "steam_appid": 3983750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chip by Chip</strong> is a <strong>short, cozy 3D platforming adventure</strong> about piecing your memories back together, one chip at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Play as a curious little robot who wakes up in a cozy pond community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👋 Meet a warm and funny cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Explore and platform your way through a lively world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Literally) Fall into a New Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ouch! You're a little robot who just fell from the sky! You wake up in a peaceful pond community, with no memories of who you are or where you're from. Collect microchips to piece your memory back together, all while making new friends and helping the inhabitants along the way. But be careful! There might be a bit more to your memories than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983750/extras/22f2a1a2602a95f4c1088d92b2a7e8f0.avif?t=1756432420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983750/extras_big/22f2a1a2602a95f4c1088d92b2a7e8f0.avif?t=1756432420 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With fun platforming, wholesome character interactions, and a focus on exploration and adventure, Chip by Chip offers a heartfelt, bite-sized journey about finding home where you least expect it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chip by Chip</strong> is a <strong>short, cozy 3D platforming adventure</strong> about piecing your memories back together, one chip at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Play as a curious little robot who wakes up in a cozy pond community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👋 Meet a warm and funny cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Explore and platform your way through a lively world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Literally) Fall into a New Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ouch! You're a little robot who just fell from the sky! You wake up in a peaceful pond community, with no memories of who you are or where you're from. Collect microchips to piece your memory back together, all while making new friends and helping the inhabitants along the way. But be careful! There might be a bit more to your memories than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983750/extras/22f2a1a2602a95f4c1088d92b2a7e8f0.avif?t=1756432420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983750/extras_big/22f2a1a2602a95f4c1088d92b2a7e8f0.avif?t=1756432420 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With fun platforming, wholesome character interactions, and a focus on exploration and adventure, Chip by Chip offers a heartfelt, bite-sized journey about finding home where you least expect it.</p>", "short_description": "Piece your memories back together in a cozy platforming adventure about finding home where you least expect it; chip by chip.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983750/2ac06fe18746019d4365837ec4f98b410315ce76/header.jpg?t=1756432420", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983750/386a5a0b1